rows.en:
"Don't talk crap!
Why the hell would he come?!"
Shindo suddenly raised his voice.{p}

"...Oh?
Shindo, you know Kanda?"
Motoki put on a big show of surprise. Whether it was real or an act, I couldn't tell.{p}

"It wasn't a lie!
I wasn't lying when I said it."
I was practically shouting.{p}

I slowly opened my eyes.
Everyone else was cautiously looking around too.
What about Kazama★{p}

...What's going on?
Did Kazama save us from Kanda?
Wasn't Kazama just a weirdo?{p}
